OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks let off in city's
OL,4,Astreets 'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage showing fireworks being set off
OL,7,Fon a busy city street were
OL,8,F"unacceptable", the government said.
OL,10,FVideo recorded on Lincoln Road in
OL,11,FPeterborough showed the sky lit up
OL,12,Fduring a series of loud explosions at
OL,13,Fabout 21:30 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,15,FCambridgeshire Police said no arrests
OL,16,Fhad been made, but officers had
OL,17,Fattended "a number of incidents" this
OL,18,Fweek relating to "inappropriate use of
OL,19,Ffireworks".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
