OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks let off in city's
OL,4,Astreets 'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, police and the council's
OL,7,Ftrading standards team seized more than
OL,8,F21kg of unlicensed fireworks from a
OL,9,Fshop in the city on Friday.
